ing","disposition":"partial"},{"source_path":"SKILL.md","line":37,"column":50,"evidence":"若调试端口文件不可读，脚本会报告 `EPERM/EACCES`，不要当成浏览器未开启调试。可在 `config.env` 用 `WEB_ACCESS_CDP_PORT` 为日常浏览器显式指定已核对的端口；端口归属由配置提供，不自动猜测，另一浏览器的 `--browser` 不借用此端口。","target_path":null,"status":"missing","disposition":"partial"},{"source_path":"SKILL.md","line":39,"column":7,"evidence":"用户数据（`config.env` 与站点经验）位于用户目录下的 `~/.web-access/`（Windows 为 `%USERPROFILE%\\.web-access\\`），不在 skill 目录内，升级 skill 不受影响。旧版本存放在 skill 目录内的数据，由前置检查首次运行时自动复制过来，并输出一行 ","target_path":null,"status":"missing","disposition":"partial"},{"source_path":"SKILL.md","line":48,"column":217,"evidence":"er <数据目录路径>`（或改写 config.env 后运行）。旧版本没有维护接口时，命令会提示一次性迁移，不自动强杀。退出码与状态字段见 [API 参考](references/cdp-api.md)。","target_path":"references/cdp-api.md","status":"resolved","disposition":"analyzed"},{"source_path":"SKILL.md","line":84,"column":20,"evidence":"**Jina**（可选预处理层，可与 WebFetch/curl 组合使用，由于其特性可节省 tokens 消耗，请积极在任务合适时组合使用）：第三方网络服务，可将网页转为 Markdown，大幅节省 token 但可能有信息损耗。调用方式为 `r.jina.ai/example.com`（URL 前加前缀，不保留原网","target_path":null,"status":"missing","disposition":"partial"},{"source_path":"SKILL.md","line":84,"column":124,"evidence":"可节省 tokens 消耗，请积极在任务合适时组合使用）：第三方网络服务，可将网页转为 Markdown，大幅节省 token 但可能有信息损耗。调用方式为 `r.jina.ai/example.com`（URL 前加前缀，不保留原网址 http 前缀），限 20 RPM。适合文章、博客、文档、PDF 等以正文为核心的","target_path":null,"status":"missing","disposition":"partial"},{"source_path":"SKILL.md","line":155,"column":60,"evidence":"curl -s -X POST \"http://localhost:3456/eval?target=ID\" -d 'document.title'","target_path":null,"status":"missing","disposition":"partial"},{"source_path":"SKILL.md","line":165,"column":61,"evidence":"curl -s -X POST \"http://localhost:3456/click?target=ID\" -d 'button.submit'","target_path":null,"status":"missing","disposition":"partial"},{"source_path":"SKILL.md","line":168,"column":63,"evidence":"curl -s -X POST \"http://localhost:3456/clickAt?target=ID\" -d 'button.upload'","target_path":null,"status":"missing","disposition":"partial"},{"source_path":"SKILL.md","line":175,"column":75,"evidence":"curl -s -X POST \"http://localhost:3456/eval?target=ID&frame=FRAME_ID\" -d 'document.body.innerText'","target_path":null,"status":"missing","disposition":"partial"},{"source_path":"SKILL.md","line":197,"column":145,"evidence":"或其它脚本中仍含 `GET /new?url=...` 或 `/navigate?target=...&url=...` 的旧写法，调用会收到迁移指引。按 [`references/migration-2.5.3.md`](references/migration-2.5.3.md) 就地改写为 POST body 后","target_path":"references/migration-2.5.3.md","status":"resolved","disposition":"analyzed"},{"source_path":"SKILL.md","line":197,"column":177,"evidence":"navigate?target=...&url=...` 的旧写法，调用会收到迁移指引。按 [`references/migration-2.5.3.md`](references/migration-2.5.3.md) 就地改写为 POST body 后再使用，并顺手把该站点经验文件更新掉。","target_path":"references/migration-2.5.3.md","status":"resolved","disposition":"analyzed"},{"source_path":"SKILL.md","line":206,"column":238,"evidence":"，共享 DOM，看不到页面的 JS 变量）；`/clickXY` 按视口坐标点中其中的元素，会逐层进入嵌套的 iframe。字段与坐标换算见 [API 参考](references/cdp-api.md)。","target_path":"references/cdp-api.md","status":"resolved","disposition":"analyzed"},{"source_path":"SKILL.md","line":302,"column":4,"evidence":"| `references/cdp-api.md` | 需要 CDP API 详细参考、JS 提取模式、错误处理时 |","target_path":"references/cdp-api.md","status":"resolved","disposition":"analyzed"}],"limitations":["Analyzer static_patterns_tool_misuse status: degraded."],"findings_before_filtering":53,"findings_after_filtering":53}}}},"signature":{"status":"unsigned"}}